              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit uses an ability that requires you to spend 1 or more **fate points**, after that ability has been resoled, roll a dice. On a 4+, gain 1 **fate point**.
If you remove 1 or more damage points from the damage pool of a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit as a result of the &apos;Destined to Serve&apos; ability, after the damage sequence for that unit has been resolved, roll a dice. On a 4+, gain 1 **fate point**.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
