                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if any damage points were allocated to the target this phase. On a 3+, the target has a maximum control score of 1 until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
